&lt;p&gt;If you have a background in law or legal services, understand how private markets firms and their advisors operate and are energised by the commercial side of the industry, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in or building partnership channels via law firms, asset management firms or professional services firms preferred. (Ideally from scratch)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the private markets ecosystem — PE, VC, credit, real assets — and how legal and compliance workstreams operate within it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing senior relationships and navigating complex, multi-stakeholder organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially sharp, with the ability to structure and close partnership deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator — confident presenting to partners, General Counsels and C-suite stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and self-directed; comfortable building something from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM tools (HubSpot preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Carta in the field, meeting with current and prospective partners and attending industry events on Carta’s behalf (up to 25% travel)&lt;/li&gt;
