&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Brazilian office, located in Rio de Janeiro, is home to a few teams here at Carta, and we’re excited to offer positions for persons with disabilities on any of them. These include - but aren’t limited to - engineering, product and design, support and onboarding, operations, and G&amp;amp;A teams. Most folks work closely and collaborate with internationally distributed teams. Working at Carta is an opportunity to build connections with and learn from talented individuals all over the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Carta is always interested in bringing on professionals who are inspired by our mission. While we have plenty of available positions listed here on our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://boards.greenhouse.io/carta&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, if there are no currently listed positions that you believe best fit your skill set, apply here and let us know what type of work you’d be interested in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Disclosures:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to providing a positive interview experience for every candidate. If accommodations due to a disability or medical condition are needed, please connect with the talent partner via email.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
