&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytically minded and meticulous.&lt;/strong&gt; You work through complex structures carefully and methodically — you catch what matters and document it clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A clear communicator in writing and in conversation.&lt;/strong&gt; Your written work is precise and professional; your verbal communication gives counterparties and colleagues confidence that you know what you&#39;re doing.&lt;/li&gt;
