&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Law Degree and licensed to practice. &lt;/strong&gt;You are licensed to practice law in the Americas (US/Canada).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech-savvy and adaptable. &lt;/strong&gt;You are comfortable working with and evolving a legal technology suite (e.g. AI tools, HighQ), and an interest in legal tech or AI is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
