&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior lawyers and paralegals, reviewing their work and contributing to a high-performing team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use and continuously improve Carta&#39;s legal technology suite, identifying ways to innovate using AI-backed tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full contract lifecycle for each matter, from first review through execution and system logging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Law Degree and licensed to practice.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re licensed to practise law in any APAC jurisdictions, the UK, US, or Canada, with 5+ PQE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track record.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve independently negotiated pre-M&amp;amp;A contracts like NDAs, NRLs, joinders, and engagement letters in a financial services legal environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trusted advisor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You build lasting relationships with sophisticated investment fund and asset manager clients and communicate legal advice crisply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially minded.&lt;/strong&gt; You balance legal risk against business objectives and flag issues before they escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative leader. &lt;/strong&gt;You mentor junior lawyers and paralegals and take ownership of your work in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech-forward highly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re proficient with AI-backed contract review tools and look for ways to improve them.&lt;/li&gt;
