&lt;p&gt;At Carta, our employees set out on a mission to unlock the power of equity ownership for more people in more places. We believe that the problems we solve today unlock the opportunities of tomorrow. As a Technical Senior Manager, Tax you’ll work to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
