&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;At Carta, our employees set out on a mission to unlock the power of equity ownership for more people in more places. We believe that the problems we solve today unlock the opportunities of tomorrow. As a Workday Integrations Architect, you’ll work to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end integration pipeline from design and configuration to deployment and production support ensuring Workday connects seamlessly with internal and external platforms via Studio, Orchestrations, Core Connectors, EIB, RaaS, and REST/SOAP APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data integrity across all inbound and outbound integrations by building rigorous mapping, transformation, and validation processes that keep Carta&#39;s people data accurate and compliant at scale&lt;/li&gt;
