&lt;li&gt;Extend Workday&#39;s capabilities through Extend applications, calculated fields, and business process automation that reduce manual work and unlock operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain key external platform connections including Greenhouse, HireVue, and others — keeping Carta&#39;s HR tech ecosystem reliable and well-integrated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team You&#39;ll Work With&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be joining Carta&#39;s People Platform team.&amp;nbsp;This team owns the systems that power how nearly 2,000 Carta employees globally experience their work from hire to retire. The People Tech team sits at the intersection of HR, IT, and engineering, building the integrations and automation that keep Carta&#39;s people data accurate, compliant, and actionable across the business. As Carta scales internationally, this team&#39;s work becomes increasingly consequential&amp;nbsp; ensuring that every system, every data flow, and every workflow keeps pace with the company&#39;s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Workday integration expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; You have 8 years of general Workday Experience and 4+ years of hands-on experience with Workday integrations — Studio, Orchestrations, Core Connectors, EIB, RaaS, REST, and SOAP — and you&#39;ve built and maintained complex integrations in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workday platform fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand the Workday data model and business processes across multiple modules, including Core HCM, Payroll, Compensation, Absence, Time Tracking, Benefits, and Security — and you know how changes in one area ripple through others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical depth.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re proficient in XML, XSLT, JSON, XSD, and SQL, and you&#39;re comfortable debugging integrations, managing API authentication, handling encryption and certificates (x509/PGP), and working within SFTP/data exchange frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve worked in global environments and can navigate the complexity that comes with multi-region, multi-system data flows and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder mentality.&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t just maintain systems — you make them smarter. Experience with Workday Extend and a working familiarity with agentic AI or LLMs (such as Claude) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
